function ConfirmMSPQualifier(args){AssertFields(args,[],['SIMPLEONLY','CONFIRMPRIMARY','HARDWORKFLOWOBSTACLES']);var $mspinsurancetypeid=jQuery('#MSPINSURANCETYPEID');Assert($mspinsurancetypeid.length==1,'missing or duplicate MSPINSURANCETYPEID field?');var mspinsurancetypeid=$mspinsurancetypeid.val();var secondaryinsurancemspinsurancetypeid=jQuery('#SECONDARYINSURANCEMSPINSURANCETYPEID').val();var secondaryismedicare=jQuery('#SECONDARYISMEDICARE').val();var primaryinsurancemspinsurancetypeid=jQuery('#PRIMARYINSURANCEMSPINSURANCETYPEID').val();var primaryismedicare=jQuery('#PRIMARYISMEDICARE').val();var requiredsecondaryclaimmessage="A Medicare Secondary Qualifier is required when Medicare is indicated as the secondary payer.  The claim will be held until a qualifier is selected.";var medicareisnotprimarymessage="The selected Medicare Secondary Qualifier indicates that Medicare should be the primary payer, but Medicare is currently registered as the patient's secondary insurance.";var secondaryqualifierfailsmatchsecondaryinsurancemessage="The Medicare Secondary Qualifier does not match the default Medicare Secondary Qualifier associated with this patient's insurance package."
+"  Please review and update the default MSQ on the patient's insurance if appropriate.";var primaryandsecondarymedicarepolicymessage="Medicare is registered as both primary and secondary.  Please review and cancel the appropriate duplicate policy.";var appropriateprimaryqualifierrequiredmessage="The selected Medicare Secondary Qualifier indicates that Medicare should be the secondary payer, but Medicare is currently registered as the patient's primary insurance.";var medicaresecondaryqualifierrequired="A Medicare Secondary Qualifier is required to indicate whether Medicare should be primary or secondary.";var passesobstacle=function(message){if(args.HARDWORKFLOWOBSTACLES){alert(message);return false;}
else{return confirm(message+"\n\nWould you like to continue?");}};if(args.CONFIRMPRIMARY){if(primaryismedicare==1&&secondaryismedicare==1){if(!passesobstacle(primaryandsecondarymedicarepolicymessage)){return false;}}
else if(primaryismedicare==1&&mspinsurancetypeid!=='0'){if(mspinsurancetypeid===''){if(!passesobstacle(medicaresecondaryqualifierrequired)){return false;}}
else{if(!passesobstacle(appropriateprimaryqualifierrequiredmessage)){return false;}}}}
if(secondaryismedicare==1){if(mspinsurancetypeid===''){if(!passesobstacle(requiredsecondaryclaimmessage)){return false;}}
else if(mspinsurancetypeid==='0'&&primaryismedicare!=1){if(!passesobstacle(medicareisnotprimarymessage)){return false;}}
else if(!args.SIMPLEONLY){if(secondaryinsurancemspinsurancetypeid&&mspinsurancetypeid&&(mspinsurancetypeid!=secondaryinsurancemspinsurancetypeid)){if(!passesobstacle(secondaryqualifierfailsmatchsecondaryinsurancemessage)){return false;}}}}
return true;}
function SizeIFrameHeightToMatchContents(frame){var frameselection=AH.Frames.Main.Frame().jQuery(frame);if(!frameselection.length){return-1;}
var framelement,framewindow;frameselection.height(35);frameelement=frameselection.get(0);framewindow=frameelement.contentWindow||frameelement.contentDocument.parentWindow;if(!framewindow){return-2;}
var size=(framewindow.document.documentElement.scrollHeight||framewindow.document.body.scrollHeight);jQuery(frameelement).height(size);return size;}
function IsNPINumber(npi){if(!npi){return true;}
else if(npi.match(/^[1-4]\d{9}$/)){var digits=('80840'+npi).split('');var total=0;for(var i=0;i<digits.length;i++){var dval=digits[digits.length-1-i]*(1+i%2);total+=(dval%10)+Math.floor(dval/10);}
return!(total%10);}
else{return false;}}
function IsDEANumber(dea){if(!dea){return true;}
else if(dea.match(/^[A-Z][A-Z9]\d{7}(-[A-Z0-9]+)?$/)){var digits=dea.split('');var calc135=Number(digits[2])+Number(digits[4])+Number(digits[6]);var calc246=Number(digits[3])+Number(digits[5])+Number(digits[7]);var check=calc135+2*calc246;var checkDigit=check.toString().slice(-1);return(checkDigit===digits[8]);}
else{return false;}}
function GetDocumentScrollPosition(){return{scrollx:document.body.scrollLeft||document.documentElement.scrollLeft,scrolly:document.body.scrollTop||document.documentElement.scrollTop};}
function Hashify(array){var hash={};jQuery.each(array,function(i,e){hash[e]=1;});return hash;}
function FocusElement(args){AssertFields(args,['selector'],['scroll','scrolltime','scrolloffset']);var $element=jQuery(args.selector);var scroll=typeof(args.scroll)!='undefined'?args.scroll:true;var scrolltime=typeof(args.scrolltime)!='undefined'?args.scrolltime:1000;var scrolloffset=typeof(args.scrolloffset)!='undefined'?args.scrolloffset:-100;$element.focus();if(scroll){var position=FindScrollingPosition($element.get(0));var offsetTop=position.top+scrolloffset;jQuery('html, body').animate({scrollTop:offsetTop},scrolltime);}}
function ParsePlural(args){AssertFields(args,['TEXT','NUMBER'],[]);var number=args.NUMBER;var text=args.TEXT;var plural=number==1?0:1;var infiniteguard=0;while(text.match(/\[\[([\w \#]*)(\|?)([\w \#]*)\]\]/)&&infiniteguard++<100){var pluraltxt=RegExp.$2?RegExp.$3:RegExp.$1;var singulartxt=RegExp.$2?RegExp.$1:RegExp.$1=="#"?RegExp.$1:'';var replacewith=plural?pluraltxt:singulartxt;replacewith=replacewith.replace(/\#/,number);text=text.replace(/\[\[([\w \#]*)(\|?)([\w \#]*)\]\]/,replacewith);}
return text;}
function FormatNumberWithCommas(args){AssertFields(args,['INTEGER'],[]);stringinteger=args.INTEGER+"";return stringinteger.replace(/(\d)(?=(\d\d\d)+(?!\d))/g,"$1,");}
function FormatDecimalsToExactPrecision(before,after){var inputValue=event.srcElement.value;var dotPosition=inputValue.indexOf('.');if(dotPosition==-1){if(inputValue.length>before){event.srcElement.value=inputValue.substring(0,before);}}
else if(dotPosition>before){event.srcElement.value=inputValue.substring(0,before);}
else if(inputValue.length-(dotPosition+1)>after){event.srcElement.value=inputValue.substring(0,dotPosition+after+1);}}
function SyncDatesToMetafilterValue(args){AssertFields(args,['REPORTDATES','TODAY','METAFILTERVALUE'],['DATEAFTERLASTVISIT','STARTDATESELECTOR','ENDDATESELECTOR','PREFIX']);var reportdates=args.REPORTDATES;var startdate,enddate;switch(args.METAFILTERVALUE){case'MTD':startdate=reportdates['FirstDayCurrentMonth'];enddate=args.TODAY;break;case'LM':startdate=reportdates['FirstDayLastMonth'];enddate=reportdates['LastDayLastMonth'];break;case'QTD':startdate=reportdates['FirstDayCurrentQuarter'];enddate=args.TODAY;break;case'LQ':startdate=reportdates['FirstDayLastQuarter'];enddate=reportdates['LastDayLastQuarter'];break;case'YTD':startdate=reportdates['FirstDayCurrentYear'];enddate=args.TODAY;break;case'LY':startdate=reportdates['FirstDayLastYear'];enddate=reportdates['LastDayLastYear'];break;case'AT':startdate='';enddate='';break;case'SLV':startdate=args.DATEAFTERLASTVISIT||'';enddate=args.TODAY;break;default:startdate='';enddate='';}
jQuery(args.STARTDATESELECTOR||'[name='+EscapeJQuerySelector(args.PREFIX||'')+'STARTDATE]').val(startdate);jQuery(args.ENDDATESELECTOR||'[name='+EscapeJQuerySelector(args.PREFIX||'')+'ENDDATE]').val(enddate);return;}
function GetFieldsForContactPreference(){var selectedvalue=jQuery("select[name='CONTACTPREFERENCE'] option:selected").val();var fields='';if(selectedvalue=='HOMEPHONE'||selectedvalue=='WORKPHONE'||selectedvalue=='MOBILEPHONE'){fields=[selectedvalue];}
if(selectedvalue=='MAIL'){fields=['ADDRESS1','ZIP','CITY','STATE_select','STATE_text'];}
return fields;}
function RemoveRequiredForContactPreference(){var prevmodified=jQuery("input[name='PREVCONTACTPREF']").val();if(prevmodified!==''){var fields=prevmodified.split(' ');jQuery.each(fields,function(i,field){jQuery('[name='+field+']').removeClass('RequiredFieldColor');});jQuery("input[name='PREVCONTACTPREF']").val('');}}
function SetRequiredForContactPreference(items){var modified='';if(items!==''){jQuery.each(items,function(i,field){if(!jQuery('[name='+field+']').hasClass('RequiredFieldColor')){jQuery('[name='+field+']').addClass('RequiredFieldColor');modified=modified.concat(field,' ');}});}
jQuery("input[name='PREVCONTACTPREF']").val(modified);jQuery("input[name='PREVCONTACTPREF']"). attr('DefaultValue',modified);}
function ToggleNoMobileCheckBox(){if(jQuery("select[name='CONTACTPREFERENCE'] option:selected").val()=='MOBILEPHONE'){if(jQuery('[name=nomobile]').prop('checked')){jQuery('[name=nomobile]').attr('checked',false);UpdateMobile();}
jQuery('[name=nomobile]').attr('disabled',true);}
else{jQuery('[name=nomobile]').attr('disabled',false);}}
function ToggleContactPreference(){if(jQuery('[name=CONTACTPREFERENCE]').length){var fields=GetFieldsForContactPreference();RemoveRequiredForContactPreference();SetRequiredForContactPreference(fields);ToggleNoMobileCheckBox();}}
function isAirlockOpen(){return IsFrameAccessible(AH.Frames.Main)&&jQuery(AH.Frames.Main.Frame().document).find('#meta-use-classic-frameset').length;}
function IsArrowKeyEvent(){return(window.event&&InList(window.event.keyCode,[37,38,39,40]))?true:false;}
function IsURLPOPPage(url){url=url.replace(/^https?:\/\//,'');return url.split('/')[2]==='pop';}
var LuhnChecksum=(function(arr){return function(ccNum){var
len=ccNum.length,bit=1,sum=0,val;while(len){val=parseInt(ccNum.charAt(--len),10);sum+=(bit^=1)?arr[val]:val;}
return sum&&sum%10===0;};}([0,2,4,6,8,1,3,5,7,9]));function FieldContainsCreditCardNumber(field){var ccregex=/\b(3[47]\d{2}([ -]?)\d{6}\2\d{5}|((4\d|5[1-5]|2[2-7]|65)\d{2}|6011)([ -]?)\d{4}\5\d{4}\5\d{4})\b/;var ccmatch=ccregex.exec(field);if(ccmatch){var number=ccmatch[1].replace(/\D/g,"");if(LuhnChecksum(number)){return ccmatch[1];}}
return false;}
function OpenPOPPages(poptarget){AH.Frames.Main.Frame().location=GetStaticURL("pophealth/loading.html");CallRemote({SUBSYSTEM:'PopulationManagement',SUB:'CreateURL',ARGS:{'TARGET':poptarget,'DEPARTMENTID':AH.GetGlobal('DEPARTMENTID')},ONFINISH:function(newurl){if(newurl){RegisterPOPReloginHandler();ProtectRedirect(AH.Frames.Main.Frame(),newurl);return;}}});return false;}
function RegisterPOPReloginHandler(){RegisterReloginHandler(function(){if(typeof(RefreshingPOPPage)==='undefined'||!RefreshingPOPPage){RefreshingPOPPage=1;RegisterReloginHandler(function(){RefreshingPOPPage=0;});if(IsURLPOPPage(AH.Frames.Main.Frame().location.href)){var poppath=AH.Frames.Main.Frame().location.pathname.replace(/\/_\/pop/,'')+
AH.Frames.Main.Frame().location.search;if(poppath.indexOf("/Login")===0){poppath="/Login/POPOnlyLanding";}
OpenPOPPages(poppath);}}});}
function ValidateUnits(unitsobj,procedureobj,largevalue){var unitsvalue=TrimWhitespace(unitsobj.value);if(unitsvalue!==''&&!unitsvalue.match(/^\-?\d+$/g)){alert("Units must be a whole number.");try{unitsobj.focus();}catch(e){};return false;}
if(unitsvalue!=''&&unitsvalue<=0){alert("Units must be a number greater than zero (or blank).");try{unitsobj.focus();}catch(e){};return false;}
if(largevalue&&isNumber(largevalue))
if(unitsvalue>largevalue){if(!confirm('You have entered a large number ('+unitsvalue+') of units of procedure '+
procedureobj.value
+'.  Click OK if it is correct or Cancel to change the units.')){try{unitsobj.focus();}catch(e){};return false;}}
unitsobj.value=unitsvalue;return unitsvalue;}
function phonepayerpopup(url,windowName)
{if(typeof phonepayerpopup.winRefs=='undefined'){phonepayerpopup.winRefs={};}
if(typeof phonepayerpopup.winRefs[windowName]=='undefined'||phonepayerpopup.winRefs[windowName].closed){phonepayerpopup.winRefs[windowName]=window.open(url,windowName,'height=500,width=700,menubar=0,resizable=1,scrollbars=1');phonepayerpopup.winRefs[windowName].moveTo(0,0);}
else{phonepayerpopup.winRefs[windowName].focus();}}
